{
  "_comment": "R2/R4 measure-only CONTROL: _simnet24_inj_pareref_on knob-verbatim (JSON round-trip), product path redirected. Solve CSVs must be byte-identical to runs/staf_on (the armed twin) - that identity IS the measure-only proof.",
  "app_mode": "post",
